:: Explicit proj selects fields from its expected result type.
:: The operation is reserved; direct calls do not insert a projection.
++ choose |= x=[a=@t b=@p] a.x
++ source |= x=@t [a=x b=~zod c=%.y]
++ trace-extra |= x=@t
  ~& "extra"
    x
++ direct ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y])
++ from-call ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj (source "hi"))
++ into-call (choose (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y]))
++ nested ^- [result=[a=@t b=@p] done=?] [result=(proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y]) done=%.y]
++ generic |= x=B ^- [a=@t b=B] (proj [a="hi" b=x c=%.y])
++ no-context (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y])
++ unknown-target |= x (proj x)
++ missing ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" c=%.y d=~zod])
++ incompatible ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" b="wrong" c=%.y])
++ trace-extra-field ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=(trace-extra "once")])
++ pending-tag ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%orphan])
++ pending-null ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=~])
++ positional ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj "hi" ~zod %.y)
++ not-record ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj "hi")
:: The user chose explicit proj; implicit projection must be rejected.
++ bare-cast ^- [a=@t b=@p] [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y]
++ bare-call (choose [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y])
++ bare-result |= x=@t ^- [a=@t b=@p] (source x)
++ bare proj
++ alias proj
++ alias-use ^- [a=@t b=@p] (alias [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y])
++ two-arguments ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y] [a="x" b=~zod c=%.y])
++ one-field ^- [a=@t] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y])
++ exact-record ^- [a=@t b=@p] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod])
++ positional-generic |= [a=@t b=B] a
++ positional-generic-call (positional-generic "hi" ~zod %.y)
++ subsequence ^- [a=@t c=?] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y])
++ reversed ^- [b=@p a=@t] (proj [a="hi" b=~zod c=%.y])
